        [LoadColumn(2)]
        public string Techniques { get; set; }
    }
    public class Prediction
    {
        [ColumnName("PredictedLabel")]
        public string PredictedTechniques { get; set; }
    }
}
```
In this code, we first load the annotated chapters from a CSV file using the `LoadFromTextFile` method. We then define a preprocessing pipeline that converts the text into a bag-of-words representation, maps the techniques to numeric labels, normalizes the features, and maps the predicted labels back to their original string representation.
