To structure an essay about the impact of technology on society using LaTeX formatting language, you can use the sectioning commands provided by LaTeX to create a hierarchical outline. Here is a sample code that you can use to create an outline for your essay:
```
\documentclass{article}
\begin{document}
\section{Introduction}
In this section, you can introduce the topic of your essay and provide some background information.
\section{Positive impacts of technology}
In this section, you can discuss the positive impacts of technology on society. You can use subsections to organize your ideas further.
\subsection{Improved communication}
