This code will create a hierarchical outline for your essay with three main sections: Introduction, Positive impacts of technology, and Negative impacts of technology. The Positive impacts and Negative impacts sections will each have two subsections to further organize your ideas. You can add more sections and subsections as needed to create a more detailed outline.

